WEBVTT

00:00:00.726 --> 00:00:01.520
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:05.361
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>If</b> a cow <b>attacked</b> me, I<b>’d run</b> away.

00:00:06.861 --> 00:00:10.360
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>If</b> she <b>didn’t have</b> a dog, she <b>wouldn’t do</b> any exercise.

00:00:11.885 --> 00:00:15.450
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Would</b> you <b>go</b> for a swim <b>if</b> there <b>were</b> sharks in the sea?

00:00:17.486 --> 00:00:18.164
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:19.196 --> 00:00:22.460
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>If</b> I <b>had</b> more time, I<b>’d do</b> more exercise.

00:00:23.946 --> 00:00:27.208
<v><b>B:</b></v> I<b>’d do</b> more exercise <b>if</b> I <b>had</b> more time.

00:00:29.231 --> 00:00:30.000
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:31.035 --> 00:00:34.879
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <b>If</b> we <b>went</b> by car, we <b>could stop</b> at places on the way.